{"number_of_reviews":15,"average_rating":"5.00","number_of_questions":0,"product_name":"Klassische Herrenuhren Edelstahl · Saphirglas, 50m wasserdicht","product_external_id":15396249960833,"product_coupons_enabled":true,"image_url":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0943/6856/3585/files/S3fd1754a28234ac4b0838d54ea43c29cx.webp?v=1779811748","histogram":[{"rating":5,"frequency":15,"percentage":100,"extra_class":null},{"rating":4,"frequency":0,"percentage":0,"extra_class":null},{"rating":3,"frequency":0,"percentage":0,"extra_class":null},{"rating":2,"frequency":0,"percentage":0,"extra_class":null},{"rating":1,"frequency":0,"percentage":0,"extra_class":null}],"review_keywords":null,"product_medals":[],"custom_form_filters_and_averages":null,"photo_gallery":[{"uuid":"e67223e2-298a-46bf-90b2-2c9b1e03e3d1","reviewer_name":"Royce Hills","reviewer_initial":"R","title":"","body_html":"<p>Absolute home run. This 36mm 316l stainless piece features a stunning sunray blue dial, sapphire glass, a crisp screw-down crown, and a beautiful polished center executive bracelet with a milled butterfly clasp. Out of the box, it comfortably fits my 9\" wrist with zero pins removed—i just shifted 3 links to the long side for a perfect balance. \n<br /> \n<br /> ​ The factory sunon sp28 provides a beautiful mechanical sweep seconds, so i am leaving it in for now. However, the dial feet position confirms this platform is 100% compatible with a miyota 2350. Having already executed this exact drop-in swap on my white version, i can verify it is a seamless mechanical upgrade path. My only minute qc observation is a microscopically misaligned date bubble, but it is so slight that no one else would ever notice. High-tier value for watch builders!</p>","verified_buyer":false,"location":"","video_external_ids":[],"media_platform_hosted_video_infos":[],"cf_answers":[],"rating":"5","created_at":"2026-05-27 00:00:00 UTC","pictures_urls":[{"original":"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/A8915b18705bf44a19b7c2807fa3ee9cdi.jpg","small":"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/A8915b18705bf44a19b7c2807fa3ee9cdi.jpg","compact":"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/A8915b18705bf44a19b7c2807fa3ee9cdi.jpg","huge":"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/A8915b18705bf44a19b7c2807fa3ee9cdi.jpg"},{"original":"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/Adf08619ce1e04e1d86fe737b211fd05b6.jpg","small":"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/Adf08619ce1e04e1d86fe737b211fd05b6.jpg","compact":"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/Adf08619ce1e04e1d86fe737b211fd05b6.jpg","huge":"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/Adf08619ce1e04e1d86fe737b211fd05b6.jpg"},{"original":"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/A4217de0cc1524a76a7d885403144d9082.jpg","small":"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/A4217de0cc1524a76a7d885403144d9082.jpg","compact":"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/A4217de0cc1524a76a7d885403144d9082.jpg","huge":"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/A4217de0cc1524a76a7d885403144d9082.jpg"},{"original":"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/A1c43df0f23064056b54c9cf636895999J.jpg","small":"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/A1c43df0f23064056b54c9cf636895999J.jpg","compact":"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/A1c43df0f23064056b54c9cf636895999J.jpg","huge":"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/A1c43df0f23064056b54c9cf636895999J.jpg"},{"original":"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/Aa9b14ffc870f4118b4c3735ecd55225eD.jpg","small":"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/Aa9b14ffc870f4118b4c3735ecd55225eD.jpg","compact":"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/Aa9b14ffc870f4118b4c3735ecd55225eD.jpg","huge":"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/Aa9b14ffc870f4118b4c3735ecd55225eD.jpg"}]},{"uuid":"d66db4fe-e32d-4ece-be79-b47b58444150","reviewer_name":"Regine Buckridge","reviewer_initial":"R","title":"","body_html":"<p>Insane value! the case and bracelet are solid steel. the bracelet has all solid links and feels very comfortable on the wrist. the crown and case back are proper screw down with o-ring gaskets. setting the watch feels very smooth and not as twitchy as on typical cheap quartz movements. the sp28 seems to be a good movement. the sweeping second hand looks great and it is very quiet, you can only hear it holding the watch to your ear. it came securely packaged in a simple box with a microfiber cloth included.</p>","verified_buyer":false,"location":"","video_external_ids":[],"media_platform_hosted_video_infos":[],"cf_answers":[],"rating":"5","created_at":"2026-05-22 00:00:00 UTC","pictures_urls":[{"original":"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/Ad6a10ac3a45846e0a5e396f341239bd1D.jpg","small":"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/Ad6a10ac3a45846e0a5e396f341239bd1D.jpg","compact":"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/Ad6a10ac3a45846e0a5e396f341239bd1D.jpg","huge":"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/Ad6a10ac3a45846e0a5e396f341239bd1D.jpg"},{"original":"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/Ae2162974953247b6b1f389c9e3ed7e44F.jpg","small":"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/Ae2162974953247b6b1f389c9e3ed7e44F.jpg","compact":"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/Ae2162974953247b6b1f389c9e3ed7e44F.jpg","huge":"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/Ae2162974953247b6b1f389c9e3ed7e44F.jpg"},{"original":"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/A3197d0546bc3474bbf115649e79185e6i.jpg","small":"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/A3197d0546bc3474bbf115649e79185e6i.jpg","compact":"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/A3197d0546bc3474bbf115649e79185e6i.jpg","huge":"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/A3197d0546bc3474bbf115649e79185e6i.jpg"},{"original":"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/Afc0c8df5759b4e65b73354bdf443a55cT.jpg","small":"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/Afc0c8df5759b4e65b73354bdf443a55cT.jpg","compact":"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/Afc0c8df5759b4e65b73354bdf443a55cT.jpg","huge":"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/Afc0c8df5759b4e65b73354bdf443a55cT.jpg"},{"original":"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/A148ed52005d34dba8c6fb849522c7ef9h.jpg","small":"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/A148ed52005d34dba8c6fb849522c7ef9h.jpg","compact":"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/A148ed52005d34dba8c6fb849522c7ef9h.jpg","huge":"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/A148ed52005d34dba8c6fb849522c7ef9h.jpg"}]},{"uuid":"14900189-4195-43b4-8f3a-faf74fdcac30","reviewer_name":"Alyse Renner","reviewer_initial":"A","title":"","body_html":"<p>Great little watch! the case size is for those who don't have large wrists. the weight is good and the build quality is great. the bracelet is easy to adjust and feels solid. the magnification is not the greatest, but it's good.</p>","verified_buyer":false,"location":"","video_external_ids":[],"media_platform_hosted_video_infos":[],"cf_answers":[],"rating":"5","created_at":"2026-05-12 00:00:00 UTC","pictures_urls":[{"original":"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/A5a4e4746b5af44038f301e468373930dT.jpg","small":"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/A5a4e4746b5af44038f301e468373930dT.jpg","compact":"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/A5a4e4746b5af44038f301e468373930dT.jpg","huge":"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/A5a4e4746b5af44038f301e468373930dT.jpg"}]},{"uuid":"d14ec489-e033-4389-b1f1-6cf3e5eff6a8","reviewer_name":"Brett Dietrich","reviewer_initial":"B","title":"","body_html":"<p>A basic yet very elegant watch. The second hand movement is smooth, similar to an automatic. Steel bracelet, sapphire glass, very good value for money.</p>","verified_buyer":false,"location":"","video_external_ids":[],"media_platform_hosted_video_infos":[],"cf_answers":[],"rating":"5","created_at":"2026-04-13 00:00:00 UTC","pictures_urls":[{"original":"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/Abd70b56aadae42b78bfadba4d20306e4m.jpg","small":"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/Abd70b56aadae42b78bfadba4d20306e4m.jpg","compact":"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/Abd70b56aadae42b78bfadba4d20306e4m.jpg","huge":"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/Abd70b56aadae42b78bfadba4d20306e4m.jpg"},{"original":"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/A9b13c44a8afc452cb93981b3a447273cH.jpg","small":"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/A9b13c44a8afc452cb93981b3a447273cH.jpg","compact":"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/A9b13c44a8afc452cb93981b3a447273cH.jpg","huge":"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/A9b13c44a8afc452cb93981b3a447273cH.jpg"}]},{"uuid":"72bcf5fb-7033-4c3a-a1fb-c43b157deff5","reviewer_name":"Bobbie Volkman","reviewer_initial":"B","title":"","body_html":"<p>The watch delivers many of the specifications expected in a good watch. Sapphire dial, stainless steel case and strap, quartz movement (probably a Sunon) simulating mechanical movement, and an unbeatable price. I paid with the taxes and discounts from the last promotion, the total being R$82. Fantastic.</p>","verified_buyer":false,"location":"","video_external_ids":[],"media_platform_hosted_video_infos":[],"cf_answers":[],"rating":"5","created_at":"2026-04-04 00:00:00 UTC","pictures_urls":[{"original":"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/Ad54e0a5449cd4783874b7195aa2472abo.jpg","small":"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/Ad54e0a5449cd4783874b7195aa2472abo.jpg","compact":"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/Ad54e0a5449cd4783874b7195aa2472abo.jpg","huge":"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/Ad54e0a5449cd4783874b7195aa2472abo.jpg"},{"original":"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/A3f2937aff40c48be84506935d67efd08q.jpg","small":"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/A3f2937aff40c48be84506935d67efd08q.jpg","compact":"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/A3f2937aff40c48be84506935d67efd08q.jpg","huge":"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/A3f2937aff40c48be84506935d67efd08q.jpg"},{"original":"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/A512e4de48d5c4d85beae5129c3258cfaB.jpg","small":"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/A512e4de48d5c4d85beae5129c3258cfaB.jpg","compact":"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/A512e4de48d5c4d85beae5129c3258cfaB.jpg","huge":"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/A512e4de48d5c4d85beae5129c3258cfaB.jpg"},{"original":"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/Ac292b65313bf4491b5528f75a2f8d607Z.jpg","small":"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/Ac292b65313bf4491b5528f75a2f8d607Z.jpg","compact":"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/Ac292b65313bf4491b5528f75a2f8d607Z.jpg","huge":"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/Ac292b65313bf4491b5528f75a2f8d607Z.jpg"},{"original":"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/A6af78be77c884d1baa332b77a11e15364.jpg","small":"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/A6af78be77c884d1baa332b77a11e15364.jpg","compact":"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/A6af78be77c884d1baa332b77a11e15364.jpg","huge":"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/A6af78be77c884d1baa332b77a11e15364.jpg"}]},{"uuid":"5f04e199-4cc9-41f1-97fd-12eede22aab0","reviewer_name":"Deon Bergstrom","reviewer_initial":"D","title":"","body_html":"<p>Looks solid, good quality. however, the magnification on the date is a bit crooked which is a little bothersome. other than that, all is well.</p>","verified_buyer":false,"location":"","video_external_ids":[],"media_platform_hosted_video_infos":[],"cf_answers":[],"rating":"5","created_at":"2026-03-30 00:00:00 UTC","pictures_urls":[{"original":"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/A20c5dda9f2244a9bb71c4812c392cc1dp.jpg","small":"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/A20c5dda9f2244a9bb71c4812c392cc1dp.jpg","compact":"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/A20c5dda9f2244a9bb71c4812c392cc1dp.jpg","huge":"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/A20c5dda9f2244a9bb71c4812c392cc1dp.jpg"},{"original":"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/A84da893205b24db6845f3304f5355f7d1.jpg","small":"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/A84da893205b24db6845f3304f5355f7d1.jpg","compact":"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/A84da893205b24db6845f3304f5355f7d1.jpg","huge":"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/A84da893205b24db6845f3304f5355f7d1.jpg"}]},{"uuid":"1e2bc5ef-930a-4e60-b5b9-3ee2ca8e29ae","reviewer_name":"Stephen Jakubowski","reviewer_initial":"S","title":"","body_html":"<p>Solid bracelet links, genuine sapphire crystal and a screw down crown for this price is simply unbeatable. It also features a sweep seconds with a sunon sp31 movement, similar to the sp28. The way it shines in the light is terrific. It looks like an expensive watch, without actually being expensive or having a fake brand name. I was worried the measurements in the description would be inaccurate, but they are true to size. I measured it with a caliper, and the diameter is indeed 36mm and the lug to lug is 46mm, slightly bigger than the actual datejust and daydate. The only thing to be noted is that the watch back came so loose that i could screw it off with my thumbs, but i managed to close it back with a watchmaker's rubber ball. I still would be wary of taking it to the pool though, and definitely don't swim with it.</p>","verified_buyer":false,"location":"","video_external_ids":[],"media_platform_hosted_video_infos":[],"cf_answers":[],"rating":"5","created_at":"2026-03-24 00:00:00 UTC","pictures_urls":[{"original":"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/A307056702d8e4339b572a849147a1fa5i.jpg","small":"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/A307056702d8e4339b572a849147a1fa5i.jpg","compact":"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/A307056702d8e4339b572a849147a1fa5i.jpg","huge":"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/A307056702d8e4339b572a849147a1fa5i.jpg"},{"original":"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/A09135582e8a34a208375b974f915a112a.jpg","small":"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/A09135582e8a34a208375b974f915a112a.jpg","c